{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"03d46e50-a84a-435b-aee8-62707a977eda","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No pwsh locally. We'll mark \"待 CI\" and can't run. Could at least parse with a PS parser? no. Be careful syntax.\n\nLet me write smoke.ps1. Ensure PowerShell 7 compatible, no fancy APIs unsupported.\n\nDetailed script:\n\n```powershell\n# 用途：win-shell（WPF）黑盒测试...\n# 前置环境：Windows + PowerShell 7 + .NET 8 已按 CI 构建；本机不构建。\n# 运行命令：pwsh -NoProfile -File tests/windows/win-shell/smoke.ps1\n# 覆盖 acceptance：A1、A2/A16、A14、A17。\n# 待 CI：本机无 .NET/桌面会话，未运行；在 GitHub Actions windows-latest 执行。\n```\n\nThen constants:\n\n```powershell\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n$RepoRoot = (Resolve-Path (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '../../..')).Path\n$WindowsRoot = Join-Path $RepoRoot 'windows'\n\n# ---- 待写手交付后对齐 ----\n# exe 路径；可用 OSAKA_WIN_EXE 覆盖。留空时按 csproj 的 AssemblyName 在 bin/ 下自动查找。\n$ExePath = if ($env:OSAKA_WIN_EXE) { $env:OSAKA_WIN_EXE } else { '' }\n# 主窗口标题；留空表示不校验标题，只等 MainWindowHandle。\n$WindowTitle = if ($env:OSAKA_WIN_WINDOW_TITLE) { $env:OSAKA_WIN_WINDOW_TITLE } else { '' }\n# 导航项显示名 → 页标识（W1/W4 来自 design/inventory.md）。页标识应出现在该页根元素的\n# AutomationId 或 Name 上；若写手用别的方式暴露页标识，改这里和 Find-PageMarker。\n$NavPages = @(\n    @{ Name = '连接'; PageId = 'W1' },\n    @{ Name = '设置'; PageId = 'W4' }\n)\n```\n\nWhat if nav order should be tested? A16 nav order 连接 then 设置. Could assert order? UIA tree order. Not necessary; task says switch both pages.\n\nFailures:\n\n```powershell\n$failures = [System.Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new()\nfunction Fail($Message) { $script:failures.Add($Message); Write-Host \"FAIL: $Message\" -ForegroundColor Red }\nfunction Pass($Message) { Write-Host \"PASS: $Message\" -ForegroundColor Green }\n```\n\nTop-level skip:\n\n```powershell\nif (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -PathType Container)) {\n    Write-Host '待测：模块未交付（windows/ 目录不存在）'\n    exit 0\n}\n```\n\nA14:\n\n```powershell\n$allowed = @('.csproj', '.cs', '.xaml')\n$sourceFiles = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File |\n    Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch '[\\\\/](bin|obj)[\\\\/]' }\n$bad = $sourceFiles | Where-Object { $allowed -notcontains $_.Extension.ToLowerInvariant() }\nif ($bad) { $bad | ForEach-Object { Fail \"A14 非允许文件：$($_.FullName.Substring($RepoRoot.Length + 1))\" } }\nelse { Pass \"A14 windows/ 只含 *.csproj/*.cs/*.xaml（$($sourceFiles.Count) 个文件）\" }\n```\n\nNote: extension \".csproj\" lowercase.\n\nBut dirs might include hidden like .config? Only files matter.\n\nA17:\n\n```powershell\n$hits = $sourceFiles | Where-Object { $_.Extension -in '.cs','.xaml' } |\n    Select-String -SimpleMatch -Pattern 'Line 01','OSA · 01'\nif ($hits) { ... } else Pass\n```\n\nSelect-String with array pattern and -SimpleMatch works. Output line format. Note encoding: pwsh 7 fine. Also case-sensitive by default (good; literal). `Select-String` on FileInfo pipeline accepts.\n\nA1 smoke:\nResolve exe:\n```powershell\nfunction Resolve-Exe {\n    if ($ExePath) { if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $ExePath) { return (Resolve-Path -LiteralPath $ExePath).Path } else { return $null } }\n    $projects = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File -Filter *.csproj |\n        Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch '[\\\\/](bin|obj)[\\\\/]' }\n    foreach ($project in $projects) {\n        $name = $project.BaseName\n        $assembly = Select-String -LiteralPath $project.FullName -Pattern '<AssemblyName>\\s*([^<]+)' | Select-Object -First 1\n        if ($assembly) { $name = $assembly.Matches[0].Groups[1].Value.Trim() }\n        $candidate = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File -Filter \"$name.exe\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue |\n            Where-Object { $_.FullName -match '[\\\\/]bin[\\\\/]' } |\n            Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 1\n        if ($candidate) { return $candidate.FullName }\n    }\n    return $null\n}\n```\n\nFilter \"$name.exe\" could match random. Fine.\n\nIf null: Fail \"A1 未找到入口 exe（构建产物缺失或待写手对齐 OSAKA_WIN_EXE）\" and skip A2? Yes, UI can't run. Use `$exe = Resolve-Exe`; if not, Fail and skip A1/A2/A16, still report A14/A17. Don't exit early.\n\nA1 run:\n```powershell\nWrite-Host \"A1 运行 $exe --self-test\"\n$process = Start-Process -FilePath $exe -ArgumentList '--self-test' -PassThru\nif (-not $process.WaitForExit(30000)) {\n    $process.Kill()\n    Fail 'A1 --self-test 30s 未退出'\n} elseif ($process.ExitCode -ne 0) {\n    Fail \"A1 --self-test 退出码 $($process.ExitCode)\"\n} else { Pass 'A1 --self-test 退出码 0' }\n```\n\nWaitForExit(int) returns bool in .NET; fine. Need `Start-Process -FilePath` with path containing spaces okay.\n\nA2/A16:\n```powershell\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName UIAutomationClient\nAdd-Type -AssemblyName UIAutomationTypes\n```\nIn pwsh 7 on Windows these are available via Add-Type.\n\nHelper:\n\n```powershell\nfunction Find-Element($Root, $AutomationId, $Name) {\n    $conditions = @()\n    if ($AutomationId) { $conditions += [System.Windows.Automation.PropertyCondition]::new([System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::AutomationIdProperty, $AutomationId) }\n    if ($Name) { $conditions += [System.Windows.Automation.PropertyCondition]::new([System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::NameProperty, $Name) }\n    $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) { $conditions[0] } else { [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new($conditions) }\n    return $Root.FindFirst([System.Windows.Automation.TreeScope]::Descendants, $condition)\n}\n```\n\nWait for element:\n```powershell\nfunction Wait-Element($Root, $AutomationId, $Name, $TimeoutSec = 10) {\n    $deadline = (Get-Date).AddSeconds($TimeoutSec)\n    do {\n        $el = Find-Element ...\n        if ($el -and -not $el.Current.IsOffscreen) { return $el }\n        Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 200\n    } while ((Get-Date) -lt $deadline)\n    return $null\n}\n```\n\nLaunch app:\n```powershell\n$app = Start-Process -FilePath $exe -PassThru\ntry {\n    $deadline = ...\n    while ($app.MainWindowHandle -eq [IntPtr]::Zero -and -not $app.HasExited -and ...) { Start-Sleep 200; $app.Refresh() }\n    if ($app.HasExited) { Fail \"A2/A16 正常启动后进程退出，退出码 $($app.ExitCode)\" }\n    elseif ($app.MainWindowHandle -eq [IntPtr]::Zero) { Fail 'A2/A16 30s 内未出现主窗口' }\n    else {\n        $window = [System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::FromHandle($app.MainWindowHandle)\n        if ($WindowTitle -and $window.Current.Name -ne $WindowTitle) { Fail ... } else pass\n        foreach ($page in $NavPages) {\n            $nav = Wait-Element $window $null $page.Name 10\n            if (-not $nav) { Fail \"A2/A16 未找到导航项“$($page.Name)”\"; continue }\n            $clicked = $false\n            try {\n                $invoke = $nav.GetCurrentPattern([System.Windows.Automation.InvokePattern]::Pattern)\n                $invoke.Invoke(); $clicked = $true\n            } catch {\n                try {\n                    $select = $nav.GetCurrentPattern([System.Windows.Automation.SelectionItemPattern]::Pattern)\n                    $select.Select(); $clicked = $true\n                } catch {}\n            }\n            if (-not $clicked) { Fail \"...导航项不支持 Invoke/Select\"; continue }\n            $marker = Wait-Element $window $page.PageId $page.PageId 10\n            if ($marker) { Pass \"A2/A16 页面 $($page.PageId)（$($page.Name)）可见\" }\n            else { Fail \"A2/A16 切换到“$($page.Name)”后未见页标识 $($page.PageId)\" }\n        }\n        # 导航顺序? skip\n    }\n} finally {\n    if (-not $app.HasExited) { $app.Kill() }\n}\n```\n\n`Wait-Element $window $null $page.Name` positional params: function signature ($Root,$AutomationId,$Name,$TimeoutSec=10). Works.\n\n`$page.PageId` hashtable property works in pwsh for hashtable keys.\n\nAutomationElement FromHandle returns element; root window Current.Name default title.\n\nPotential issue: `$app.MainWindowHandle` remains zero with WPF? It updates after Refresh. WPF MainWind