nPotential issue: FindFirst on window root itself? If page marker is root element's AutomationId? Root is window, marker in descendants. Page root is descendant. Fine.\n\n`$nav.GetCurrentPattern(...)` returns object; `.Invoke()` chained works? In PowerShell, method call on method result works: `$nav.GetCurrentPattern(...).Invoke()`. Yes.\n\n`Start-Process ... -PassThru` then `$selfTest.WaitForExit(30000)`: WaitForExit(int) returns bool. Good.\n\n`$selfTest.ExitCode` after WaitForExit true is available.\n\n`$app.Kill()` in finally; if process already killed? HasExited check. Race possible but fine.\n\nOne concern: `Add-Type -AssemblyName UIAutomationClient` in PowerShell 7 — assembly names are `UIAutomationClient` and `UIAutomationTypes`; should work on Windows.\n\nOrCondition cast fix. Also `[System.Windows.Automation.Condition[]]` type name correct.\n\nAnother issue: `$conditions += [PropertyCondition]::new(...)` where conditions is @() array; adding object results Object[]. Cast at OrCondition.\n\nOne more: In the A17 hits, `$_.Path` — MatchInfo.Path property exists. Good. `$_.Line.Trim()`.\n\nA14 file path substring: RepoRoot length + 1; if file directly under repo? windows/... so safe.\n\nA14: sourceFiles includes files in windows/ root. Fine.\n\nA17: If no files, `$hits` null → pass. Fine.\n\nWait, A14 lists only *.csproj/*.cs/*.xaml, but a typical WPF project also includes app.manifest, .resx, .json, .sln, Directory.Build.props — all would fail per acceptance. That's the spec. Good.\n\nNow, \"产品代码未交付时：测试必须清楚输出...以 pytest skip（或脚本退出码 0 + 该提示）结束\". Done.\n\nShould I add tests/INDEX.md entry? Not allowed (only tests/windows/win-shell/). No.\n\nNeed maybe record results? Task card says only these files. The tester instructions say \"完成后只回复：新建的文件清单 + 一句话说明.\" So brief reply.\n\nBut before final, maybe run a PowerShell syntax lint via a tool? There might be `pwsh` unavailable. Could install? No network, no. Check `powershell`? likely not. Skip and note risk.\n\nFix OrCondition cast.","signature":"f60c5d6e-eff1-47ad-9a05-3c7f7062b6ad"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":237,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":27904,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"befe153c-b82d-4792-9ae9-6d63c8cbba56","uuid":"b241bf4a-b225-4d79-bee6-39754c23d81a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:03:14.219Z","thinking_duration_ms":6798,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"f60c5d6e-eff1-47ad-9a05-3c7f7062b6ad","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_tjskav0DOA3Id1ycytBC2841","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/windows/win-shell/smoke.ps1","old_string":"        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) { $conditions[0] } else { [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new($conditions) }","new_string":"        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) {\n            $conditions[0]\n        } else {\n            [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new([System.Windows.Automation.Condition[]]$conditions)\n        }"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":237,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":27904,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"befe153c-b82d-4792-9ae9-6d63c8cbba56","uuid":"7c852f91-73d9-474c-85a2-d8b6bd57162a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:03:14.606Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_tjskav0DOA3Id1ycytBC2841","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/windows/win-shell/smoke.ps1 has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"befe153c-b82d-4792-9ae9-6d63c8cbba56","uuid":"f3097eb6-c7f4-48cd-acd2-a12a646b7a37","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:03:14.620Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/windows/win-shell/smoke.ps1","oldString":"        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) { $conditions[0] } else { [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new($conditions) }","newString":"        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) {\n            $conditions[0]\n        } else {\n            [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new([System.Windows.Automation.Condition[]]$conditions)\n        }","originalFile":"# 用途：win-shell（Windows .NET 8 WPF）黑盒冒烟与静态约束测试。\n#   A1  --self-test 启动自检退出码 0。\n#   A2/A16 正常启动后点导航“连接/设置”，断言页面标识 W1/W4 可见。\n#   A14 windows/ 下只允许 *.csproj/*.cs/*.xaml。\n#   A17 windows/ 源码不含线路字面量 “Line 01” / “OSA · 01”。\n# 前置环境：Windows + PowerShell 7；.NET 8 产物已由 CI 构建（本脚本不构建）。\n# 运行命令：pwsh -NoProfile -File tests/windows/win-shell/smoke.ps1\n# 覆盖 acceptance：A1、A2、A16、A14、A17。\n# 待 CI：本机无 .NET/桌面会话，未运行；目标 GitHub Actions windows-latest。\n# 产品未交付时输出“待测：模块未交付”并退出 0。\n\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n$RepoRoot = (Resolve-Path (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '../../..')).Path\n$WindowsRoot = Join-Path $RepoRoot 'windows'\n\n# ---- 待写手交付后对齐 ----\n# 入口 exe；可用 OSAKA_WIN_EXE 覆盖。留空时按 csproj 的 AssemblyName 在 bin/ 下自动查找。\n$ExePath = if ($env:OSAKA_WIN_EXE) { $env:OSAKA_WIN_EXE } else { '' }\n# 主窗口标题；留空则只等主窗口出现，不校验标题。\n$WindowTitle = if ($env:OSAKA_WIN_WINDOW_TITLE) { $env:OSAKA_WIN_WINDOW_TITLE } else { '' }\n# 导航项显示名 → 设计稿页标识（design/inventory.md：W1、W4）。\n# 约定页标识出现在该页某个元素的 AutomationId 或 Name 上；若写手用其他方式暴露，改这里。\n$NavPages = @(\n    @{ Name = '连接'; PageId = 'W1' },\n    @{ Name = '设置'; PageId = 'W4' }\n)\n\n$failures = [System.Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new()\nfunction Fail($Message) { $script:failures.Add($Message); Write-Host \"FAIL: $Message\" -ForegroundColor Red }\nfunction Pass($Message) { Write-Host \"PASS: $Message\" -ForegroundColor Green }\n\nif (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -PathType Container)) {\n    Write-Host '待测：模块未交付（windows/ 目录不存在）'\n    exit 0\n}\n\n# A14：只允许 *.csproj/*.cs/*.xaml。\n# shortcut: 跳过 bin/obj（构建产物），CI 在构建后扫描源码树。\n$sourceFiles = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File |\n    Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch '[\\\\/](bin|obj)[\\\\/]' }\n$allowedExtensions = @('.csproj', '.cs', '.xaml')\n$badFiles = $sourceFiles | Where-Object { $allowedExtensions -notcontains $_.Extension.ToLowerInvariant() }\nif ($badFiles) {\n    $badFiles | ForEach-Object { Fail \"A14 非允许文件：$($_.FullName.Substring($RepoRoot.Length + 1))\" }\n} else {\n    Pass \"A14 windows/ 只含 *.csproj/*.cs/*.xaml（$($sourceFiles.Count) 个文件）\"\n}\n\n# A17：源码不含线路字面量（资源文件不在本任务范围）。\n$hits = $sourceFiles |\n    Where-Object { $_.Extension.ToLowerInvariant() -in @('.cs', '.xaml') } |\n    Select-String -SimpleMatch -Pattern 'Line 01', 'OSA · 01'\nif ($hits) {\n    $hits | ForEach-Object { Fail \"A17 线路字面量：$($_.Path.Substring($RepoRoot.Length + 1)):$($_.LineNumber): $($_.Line.Trim())\" }\n} else {\n    Pass 'A17 windows/ 源码不含 “Line 01” / “OSA · 01”'\n}\n\nfunction Resolve-Exe {\n    if ($ExePath) {\n        if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $ExePath -PathType Leaf) { return (Resolve-Path -LiteralPath $ExePath).Path }\n        return $null\n    }\n    $projects = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File -Filter *.csproj |\n        Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch '[\\\\/](bin|obj)[\\\\/]' }\n    foreach ($project in $projects) {\n        $name = $project.BaseName\n        $assembly = Select-String -LiteralPath $project.FullName -Pattern '<AssemblyName>\\s*([^<]+)' | Select-Object -First 1\n        if ($assembly) { $name = $assembly.Matches[0].Groups[1].Value.Trim() }\n        $candidate = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $WindowsRoot -Recurse -File -Filter \"$name.exe\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue |\n            Where-Object { $_.FullName -match '[\\\\/]bin[\\\\/]' } |\n            Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending |\n            Select-Object -First 1\n        if ($candidate) { return $candidate.FullName }\n    }\n    return $null\n}\n\n$exe = Resolve-Exe\nif (-not $exe) {\n    Fail 'A1/A2/A16 未找到入口 exe（CI 未构建或需用 OSAKA_WIN_EXE 对齐路径）'\n} else {\n    Write-Host \"入口：$exe\"\n\n    # A1：--self-test 30s 内退出且退出码 0。\n    $selfTest = Start-Process -FilePath $exe -ArgumentList '--self-test' -WorkingDirectory (Split-Path $exe) -PassThru\n    if (-not $selfTest.WaitForExit(30000)) {\n        $selfTest.Kill()\n        Fail 'A1 --self-test 30s 未退出'\n    } elseif ($selfTest.ExitCode -ne 0) {\n        Fail \"A1 --self-test 退出码 $($selfTest.ExitCode)\"\n    } else {\n        Pass 'A1 --self-test 退出码 0'\n    }\n\n    # A2/A16：正常启动 → 逐个点导航项 → 断言页标识可见。\n    Add-Type -AssemblyName UIAutomationClient\n    Add-Type -AssemblyName UIAutomationTypes\n\n    function Find-Element($Root, $AutomationId, $ElementName) {\n        $conditions = @()\n        if ($AutomationId) {\n            $conditions += [System.Windows.Automation.PropertyCondition]::new(\n                [System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::AutomationIdProperty, $AutomationId)\n        }\n        if ($ElementName) {\n            $conditions += [System.Windows.Automation.PropertyCondition]::new(\n                [System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::NameProperty, $ElementName)\n        }\n        if ($conditions.Count -eq 0) { return $null }\n        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) { $conditions[0] } else { [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new($conditions) }\n        return $Root.FindFirst([System.Windows.Automation.TreeScope]::Descendants, $condition)\n    }\n\n    function Wait-Element($Root, $AutomationId, $ElementName, $TimeoutSec = 10) {\n        $deadline = (Get-Date).AddSeconds($TimeoutSec)\n        do {\n            $element = Find-Element $Root $AutomationId $ElementName\n            if ($element -and -not $element.Current.IsOffscreen) { return $element }\n            Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 200\n        } while ((Get-Date) -lt $deadline)\n        return $null\n    }\n\n    $app = Start-Process -FilePath $exe -WorkingDirectory (Split-Path $exe) -PassThru\n    try {\n        $deadline = (Get-Date).AddSeconds(30)\n        while ($app.MainWindowHandle -eq [IntPtr]::Zero -and -not $app.HasExited -and (Get-Date) -lt $deadline) {\n            Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 200\n            $app.Refresh()\n        }\n        if ($app.HasExited) {\n            Fail \"A2/A16 正常启动后进程退出，退出码 $($app.ExitCode)\"\n        } elseif ($app.MainWindowHandle -eq [IntPtr]::Zero) {\n            Fail 'A2/A16 30s 内未出现主窗口'\n        } else {\n            $window = [System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::FromHandle($app.MainWindowHandle)\n            if ($WindowTitle -and $window.Current.Name -ne $WindowTitle) {\n                Fail \"A2/A16 窗口标题为“$($window.Current.Name)”，期望“$WindowTitle”\"\n            }\n            foreach ($page in $NavPages) {\n                $nav = Wait-Element $window $null $page.Name\n                if (-not $nav) { Fail \"A2/A16 未找到导航项“$($page.Name)”\"; continue }\n\n                $clicked = $false\n                try {\n                    $nav.GetCurrentPattern([System.Windows.Automation.InvokePattern]::Pattern).Invoke()\n                    $clicked = $true\n                } catch {\n                    try {\n                        $nav.GetCurrentPattern([System.Windows.Automation.SelectionItemPattern]::Pattern).Select()\n                        $clicked = $true\n                    } catch { }\n                }\n                if (-not $clicked) { Fail \"A2/A16 导航项“$($page.Name)”不支持 Invoke/Select\"; continue }\n\n                $marker = Wait-Element $window $page.PageId $page.PageId\n                if ($marker) {\n                    Pass \"A2/A16 页面 $($page.PageId)（$($page.Name)）标识可见\"\n                } else {\n                    Fail \"A2/A16 切换到“$($page.Name)”后未见页标识 $($page.PageId)\"\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    } finally {\n        if (-not $app.HasExited) { $app.Kill() }\n    }\n}\n\nif ($failures.Count -gt 0) {\n    Write-Host \"`n失败 $($failures.Count) 项：\"\n    $failures | ForEach-Object { Write-Host \" - $_\" }\n    exit 1\n}\nWrite-Host '全部通过。'\nexit 0\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":108,"oldLines":7,"newStart":108,"newLines":11,"lines":["                 [System.Windows.Automation.AutomationElement]::NameProperty, $ElementName)","         }","         if ($conditions.Count -eq 0) { return $null }","-        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) { $conditions[0] } else { [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new($conditions) }","+        $condition = if ($conditions.Count -eq 1) {","+            $conditions[0]","+        } else {","+            [System.Windows.Automation.OrCondition]::new([System.Windows.Automation.Condition[]]$conditions)","+        }","         return $Root.FindFirst([System.Windows.Automation.TreeScope]::Descendants, $condition)","     }"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_00_tjskav0DOA3Id1ycytBC2841","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
